  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds CC035 (Info): reports an empty catch of OperationCanceledException, which silently turns a cancellation into an apparent success so the caller cannot tell the work did not finish. Complements CC019, which covers only broad catch clauses. Scoped to the empty body: any statement, a when filter, a rethrow, or a comment recording the intent keeps the rule quiet, so the idiomatic wait-until-cancelled handler stays clean. Analyzer-only. 35 diagnostics.",
